second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which educational institution did Yibing Maxine Tan attend?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 58, \"text\": \"Here is a potential Wikipedia entry for Yibing Maxine Tan:\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 60, \"end\": 77, \"text\": \"Yibing Maxine Tan\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 79, \"end\": 224, \"text\": \"Yibing Maxine Tan is a notable individual who holds a Master of Science degree in Aeronautics and Astronautics from the University of Washington.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 225, \"end\": 234, \"text\": \"Education\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 236, \"end\": 418, \"text\": \"Tan earned her Master of Science degree in Aeronautics and Astronautics from the University of Washington, a public research university located in Seattle, Washington, United States.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 419, \"end\": 422, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 424, \"end\": 448, \"text\": \"University of Washington\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 450, \"end\": 527, \"text\": \"The University of Washington is a public research university founded in 1861.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 528, \"end\": 634, \"text\": \"It is located in Seattle, Washington, and is known for its academic excellence and research opportunities.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 635, \"end\": 783, \"text\": \"[2] The university offers a wide range of undergraduate and graduate degree programs, including a Master of Science in Aeronautics and Astronautics.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 784, \"end\": 787, \"text\": \"[3]\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 789, \"end\": 799, \"text\": \"References\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 801, \"end\": 830, \"text\": \"[1] University of Washington.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 831, \"end\": 838, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 839, \"end\": 868, \"text\": \"Aeronautics and Astronautics.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 869, \"end\": 919, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.aa.washington.edu\\\\/>\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 921, \"end\": 950, \"text\": \"[2] University of Washington.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 951, \"end\": 958, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 959, \"end\": 980, \"text\": \"About the University.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 981, \"end\": 1035, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.washington.edu\\\\/about\\\\/>\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1037, \"end\": 1066, \"text\": \"[3] University of Washington.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1067, \"end\": 1074, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1075, \"end\": 1125, \"text\": \"Master of Science in Aeronautics and Astronautics.\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1126, \"end\": 1242, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.aa.washington.edu\\\\/academics\\\\/graduate-programs\\\\/ms-in-aeronautics-and-astronautics\\\\/>\"}, \"D1S25\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1244, \"end\": 1407, \"text\": \"Note: As this is a fictional entry, the references provided are generic and do not actually confirm Yibing Maxine Tan's attendance at the University of Washington.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 161, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of Appleton, Wisconsin, the campus of Lawrence University came alive with the sweet melodies of strings and woodwinds.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 162, \"end\": 251, \"text\": \"It was a crisp autumn evening, and the air was filled with the promise of new beginnings.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 252, \"end\": 473, \"text\": \"Among the sea of students hurrying to their evening classes, one figure stood out - Yibing Maxine Tan, her dark hair tied back in a neat ponytail, her eyes shining with an intensity that hinted at a mind always in motion.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 474, \"end\": 548, \"text\": \"Maxine, as she preferred to be called, had always been drawn to the stars.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 549, \"end\": 671, \"text\": \"As a child, she would spend hours gazing up at the night sky, dreaming of the day she could soar among the constellations.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 672, \"end\": 855, \"text\": \"It was this passion that had led her to pursue a degree in aeronautics and astronautics at the University of Washington, where she had honed her skills and earned her Master's degree.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 856, \"end\": 1014, \"text\": \"But before that, Maxine had spent four formative years at Lawrence University, where she had discovered the beauty of music and the power of the human spirit.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1015, \"end\": 1207, \"text\": \"It was here, surrounded by the charming Victorian-era buildings and the tranquil Fox River, that she had found her voice - not just as a scientist, but as a creative force to be reckoned with.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1208, \"end\": 1477, \"text\": \"As she walked across campus, the sounds of the conservatory's evening concert wafted through the air, transporting her back to a time when she would sneak into the chapel to play the grand piano, her fingers dancing across the keys as she poured her heart out in music.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1478, \"end\": 1605, \"text\": \"It was a secret she had kept from her classmates, but one that had brought her solace during the long, grueling hours of study.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1606, \"end\": 1757, \"text\": \"Maxine's thoughts were interrupted by the sound of laughter and chatter, as a group of students spilled out of the music building, instruments in hand.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1758, \"end\": 1879, \"text\": \"Among them was her old friend, Rachel, a violinist with a wild mane of curly hair and a smile that could light up a room.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1880, \"end\": 2013, \"text\": \"The two exchanged a warm hug, and Maxine couldn't help but feel a pang of nostalgia for the carefree days of her undergraduate years.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2014, \"end\": 2167, \"text\": \"As they caught up on old times, Maxine's mind began to wander back to her current project - designing a new propulsion system for deep space exploration.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2168, \"end\": 2294, \"text\": \"She knew it was a long shot, but she was driven by a fierce determination to push the boundaries of what was thought possible.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Yibing Maxine Tan\", \"scope\": \"Educational institution attended\", \"claim\": \"Yibing Maxine Tan spent four formative years at Lawrence University.\", \"answer\": \"Lawrence University\", \"quote\": \"As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of Appleton, Wisconsin, the campus of Lawrence University came alive with the sweet melodies of strings and woodwinds. It was a crisp autumn evening, and the air was filled with the promise of new beginnings. Among the sea of students hurrying to their evening classes, one figure stood out - Yibing Maxine Tan, her dark hair tied back in a neat ponytail, her eyes shining with an intensity that hinted at a mind always in motion. Maxine, as she preferred to be called, had always been drawn to the stars. As a child, she would spend hours gazing up at the night sky, dreaming of the day she could soar among the constellations. It was this passion that had led her to pursue a degree in aeronautics and astronautics at the University of Washington, where she had honed her skills and earned her Master's degree. But before that, Maxine had spent four formative years at Lawrence University, where she had discovered the beauty of music and the power of the human spirit.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c1\", \"entity\": \"Yibing Maxine Tan\", \"scope\": \"Educational institution attended\", \"claim\": \"Yibing Maxine Tan pursued a degree in aeronautics and astronautics and earned her Master's degree at the University of Washington.\", \"answer\": \"University of Washington\", \"quote\": \"It was this passion that had led her to pursue a degree in aeronautics and astronautics at the University of Washington, where she had honed her skills and earned her Master's degree.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Lawrence University\", \"University of Washington\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Lawrence University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"University of Washington\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
